{"version":1,"content":"<p>三五知己約出嚟食飯，少不免摸吓酒杯底，而無可否認，有唔少情緣都喺酒精催化下撻着。</p><p>AV業界資深人士神仙乙表示，人喺飲咗酒之後，心情放鬆，示愛嘅膽量亦會大啲，AV界就成日有男女主角喺帶住幾分醉意嘅情況下發展出超友誼關係。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T14:21:41.489789+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T14:00:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T14:18:15.280151+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:18:15.280151+00:00","content_hash":"ae467db1dc1225354ceba670f38ad9def820bca114a8caebe4f7f5ea8792d401","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}